    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals for 2 studies in children: cerebrospinal fluid (CSF) with a composite reference standard. Sensitivity ranges from 0.12 to 0.19, while specificity is 1.00 in all studies.",
